          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 103008,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vamos nos acostumar mais a trabalhar com arrow functions. Para isso, vamos ver como usar parâmetros dentro de arrow functions.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"discount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" - (discount * \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"0.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"375\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>discount</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vamos nos acostumar mais a trabalhar com arrow functions. Para isso, vamos ver como usar parâmetros dentro de arrow functions.</p><p>Use o desconto passado para <code>getPrice</code> para que um desconto de 25% faça o resultado ser <code>375</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"discount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" - (discount * \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"0.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getTotal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tax\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0.5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"250\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"375\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>getPrice</code> seguido de <code>discount</code> e finalmente <code>0.25</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "One parameter",
            "id": 103009,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os parâmetros em funções de seta são semelhantes aos parâmetros em funções normais. Codifique uma função de seta que use <code>total</code> como um parâmetro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>total</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os parâmetros de arrow functions são semelhantes aos parâmetros de funções normais.</p><p>Complete a função para que <code>getPrice(500)</code> aplique o desconto de 10% e exiba <code>450</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getTotal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"discount\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>getPrice</code> seguido de <code>total</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>return</code> e finalmente <code>getPrice</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One parameter II",
            "id": 103324,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em funções arrow, não precisamos adicionar os parênteses se tivermos apenas um parâmetro. Codifique o parâmetro <code>total</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>total</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Default parameter value",
            "id": 103010,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os valores dos parâmetros são definidos como <code>undefined</code> por padrão. Se uma chamada de função não passar um valor, a função usará <code>undefined</code> como valor.</p><p>Chame a função <code>getPrice()</code> abaixo para ver ela exibir <code>NaN</code>, o que significa que é um valor indefinido.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tax = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total + (tax * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NaN\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>getPrice</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os valores dos parâmetros são definidos como <code>undefined</code> por padrão. Se uma chamada de função não passar um valor, a função usará <code>undefined</code> como valor.</p><p>Use <code>console.log</code> para exibir o resultado de chamar <code>getPrice</code> sem valor: <code>NaN</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tax = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total + (tax * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tax\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.error\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getPrice(0)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"total()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NaN\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>total</code> seguido de <code>console.log</code> e finalmente <code>getPrice()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Default parameter value II",
            "id": 103108,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para evitar valores indefinidos, especificamos o valor padrão dentro dos parênteses.</p><p>Defina o valor padrão do parâmetro dentro dos parênteses para <code>total=200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"168\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>total</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para evitar valores undefined, defina um padrão nos parênteses com <code>=</code>, como <code>total = 200</code>.</p><p>Use <code>200</code> como total padrão e chame a função sem argumento para exibir <code>168</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"discount\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getPrice(200)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"168\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>total</code> seguido de <code>=</code>, <code>200</code> e finalmente <code>getPrice()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple parameters",
            "id": 103011,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para usar múltiplos parâmetros, adicionamos o novo parâmetro entre parênteses e o separamos dos demais adicionando uma vírgula <code>,</code>.</p><p>Adicione um parâmetro padrão adicional.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", discount = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" total - (discount /\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"194\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>,</code> seguido de <code>discount</code> e depois <code>=</code>, <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para usar múltiplos parâmetros, adicionamos o novo parâmetro entre parênteses e o separamos dos demais adicionando uma vírgula <code>,</code>.</p><p>Adicione o desconto padrão que faz a chamada sem argumentos exibir <code>194</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", discount = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" total - (discount /\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tax\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"194\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>,</code> seguido de <code>discount</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>3</code>, <code>/</code> e finalmente <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Summary",
            "id": 103323,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Funções arrow nos permitem ter um código mais compacto e conciso. Como as escrevemos depende dos parâmetros que usamos e do tamanho do bloco de código.</p><p>Essas funções serão essenciais mais tarde quando as usarmos em códigos mais complexos, como React.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Funções arrow nos permitem ter um código mais compacto e conciso. Como as escrevemos depende dos parâmetros que usamos e do tamanho do bloco de código.</p><p>Complete a arrow function e a chamada que aplicam um desconto de 10% a <code>500</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getPrice()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>getPrice</code> seguido de <code>=&gt;</code> e finalmente <code>getPrice</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One parameter",
            "id": 103683,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com o código a seguir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getTitle =&gt; movie {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;20th Century: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + movie;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O parâmetro <code>movie</code> deve vir após <code>=</code> e antes de <code>=&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O parâmetro <code>movie</code> deve vir antes dos parênteses <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O parâmetro <code>movie</code> deve vir após <code>=</code> e antes de <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual dupla de alterações transforma o código mostrado em uma função que retorna o título de filme criado?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getTitle =&gt; movie {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;20th Century: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + movie;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Colocar <code>movie</code> entre <code>=</code> e <code>=&gt;</code> e retornar a string criada.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mover <code>getTitle</code> para depois de <code>=&gt;</code> e exibir a string dentro da função.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Mover <code>movie</code> para depois do corpo da função e remover as chaves.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Colocar <code>movie</code> entre <code>=</code> e <code>=&gt;</code> e retornar a string criada.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One parameter II",
            "id": 103684,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como podemos encurtar o seguinte código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getDouble = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" number * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getDouble(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Removendo os parênteses <code>()</code> ao redor de <code>number</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Removendo as chaves <code>{}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Removendo os parênteses <code>()</code> ao redor de <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual alteração mantém <code>getDouble(4)</code> válido e ainda exibe <code>8</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getDouble = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" number * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getDouble(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Removendo os parênteses <code>()</code> ao redor de <code>number</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Remover <code>=&gt;</code> antes de <code>number * 2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Remover <code>number</code> e deixar os parênteses vazios <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Removendo os parênteses <code>()</code> ao redor de <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One parameter III",
            "id": 103850,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getSquare = number,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" multiplier =&gt; number * multiplier;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getSquare(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Os parênteses em torno dos dois parâmetros estão faltando</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos usar múltiplos parâmetros com arrow functions</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Os parênteses em torno dos dois parâmetros estão faltando.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual dupla de correções permite que esta função multiplique <code>4</code> por um multiplicador fornecido?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getSquare = number,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" multiplier =&gt; number * multiplier;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getSquare(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Colocar os dois parâmetros entre parênteses e passar um multiplicador na chamada.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mover os dois parâmetros para depois da seta e remover a vírgula.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Manter a lista de parâmetros como está e substituir a multiplicação pela adição.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Colocar os dois parâmetros entre parênteses e passar um multiplicador na chamada.</p></body></html>"
