            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getRatio = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"nom, denom\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" nom / denom;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getRatio(\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>40</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A chamada atribui <code>20</code> a <code>nom</code> e <code>2</code> a <code>denom</code>. Qual é o resultado da divisão?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getRatio = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"nom, denom\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" nom / denom;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getRatio(\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>40</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>22</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
